---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Orthopaedic & Spine Conditions | Dr. Aayush Shrestha Nepal"
  description="Explore spine, knee, hip, shoulder, hand, foot, arthritis and trauma conditions assessed by an orthopaedic and spine surgeon in Nepal."
  canonical="https://draayushshrestha.com/conditions.html"
  active="conditions"
>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="shell page-hero"><p class="kicker">Conditions &amp; symptoms</p><h1>What hurts?</h1><p>Common orthopaedic and spine problems treated by Dr. Aayush Shrestha.</p></section>
    <section class="section section--tight"><div class="shell directory">
      <article class="directory__item" id="spine"><h2>Spine: back &amp; neck</h2><ul><li>Back and neck pain</li><li>Sciatica, cervical and lumbar radiculopathy</li><li>Herniated and bulging discs</li><li>Degenerative disc disease and spondylosis</li><li>Spinal stenosis</li><li>Spondylolisthesis and spondylolysis</li><li>Scoliosis, kyphosis and lordosis abnormalities</li><li>Spinal infection, tumour and trauma</li></ul></article>
      <article class="directory__item" id="joints"><h2>Joint &amp; arthritis conditions</h2><ul><li>Osteoarthritis of the knee, hip and shoulder</li><li>Rheumatoid arthritis</li><li>Post-traumatic arthritis</li><li>Chronic knee, hip and shoulder pain</li><li>Bursitis and synovitis</li><li>Frozen shoulder and joint contractures</li></ul></article>
      <article class="directory__item" id="upper-limb"><h2>Sports &amp; soft-tissue injuries</h2><ul><li>ACL, PCL, MCL and LCL injuries</li><li>Ankle ligament sprains</li><li>Meniscus, cartilage and labral injuries</li><li>Rotator cuff, Achilles and patellar tendon injuries</li><li>Tennis elbow, golfer’s elbow and tendinopathy</li><li>Muscle strains and tears</li></ul></article>
      <article class="directory__item" id="trauma"><h2>Trauma &amp; fractures</h2><ul><li>Simple, compound and complex fractures</li><li>Joint dislocations and polytrauma</li><li>Wrist, hip, ankle and clavicle fractures</li><li>Stress fractures</li><li>Malunion, nonunion and delayed union</li></ul></article>
      <article class="directory__item"><h2>Joint replacement &amp; reconstruction</h2><ul><li>Osteoarthritis</li><li>Avascular necrosis</li><li>Severe joint damage</li></ul></article>
      <article class="directory__item" id="hand-foot"><h2>Hand, wrist &amp; elbow</h2><ul><li>Carpal tunnel syndrome</li><li>Cubital tunnel syndrome</li><li>Trigger finger</li><li>Ganglion cysts</li><li>Hand fractures and tendon injuries</li></ul></article>
      <article class="directory__item"><h2>Foot &amp; ankle</h2><ul><li>Plantar fasciitis</li><li>Bunions, hammertoe and mallet toe</li><li>Ankle sprain and chronic ankle instability</li><li>Achilles tendinitis</li></ul></article>
      <article class="directory__item"><h2>Bone &amp; joint infections</h2><ul><li>Osteomyelitis</li><li>Septic arthritis</li><li>Implant-related infections</li></ul></article>
      <article class="directory__item"><h2>Orthopaedic tumours</h2><ul><li>Benign and malignant bone tumours</li><li>Soft-tissue tumours</li><li>Metastatic bone disease</li></ul></article>
      <article class="directory__item"><h2>Paediatric orthopaedics</h2><ul><li>Clubfoot</li><li>Developmental dysplasia of the hip</li><li>Paediatric scoliosis and limb deformities</li><li>Fractures in children</li></ul></article>
      <article class="directory__item"><h2>Metabolic bone disease</h2><ul><li>Osteoporosis</li><li>Osteopenia</li><li>Avascular necrosis</li></ul></article>
      <article class="directory__item"><h2>Musculoskeletal pain</h2><ul><li>Chronic body and muscle pain</li><li>Ligament pain</li><li>Postural problems</li><li>Work-related musculoskeletal disorders</li></ul></article>
      <article class="directory__item"><h2>Treatments offered</h2><ul><li>Physiotherapy, rehabilitation, bracing and supports</li><li>Pain medication and lifestyle modification</li><li>Steroid, PRP and hyaluronic acid injections</li><li>Fracture fixation</li><li>Spine decompression and fusion</li><li>Tumour surgery</li></ul></article>
    </div></section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
